        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-100 pt-4">Which Expensify Alternative Is Right for You?</h2>
        <p>For most teams, the choice comes down to <strong>transparency vs. convenience</strong>. If you're tired of wondering whether your AI got the right data, PDF2DataAI's per-field confidence scoring is the clear winner. You can see exactly what the AI knows and what needs a second look.</p>
        <p>If you need deep accounting software integration, Dext might be a better fit. For enterprise-scale invoice processing, Rossum or ABBYY offer more customization at a higher price point.</p>
        <p>But if you want a tool that treats you like a partner rather than a black box — showing you its confidence for every field and letting you review only what needs attention — <a href="/upload" class="text-brand-400 underline hover:text-brand-300">try PDF2DataAI for free today</a>.</p>
